{"seq":2,"slug":"production-tuning-kernel-version-sqe-batching-cqe-overflow","title":"生产调优：内核版本特性矩阵、SQE 批处理、CQE 溢出与内存锁定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/io-uring-linux-high-performance-async-io-engineering/perf-tuning-language-bindings-production/production-tuning-kernel-version-sqe-batching-cqe-overflow","wordCount":2276,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"生产调优-内核版本特性矩阵-sqe-批处理-cqe-溢出与内存锁定\">生产调优：内核版本特性矩阵、SQE 批处理、CQE 溢出与内存锁定</h1><p>把一个 io_uring 程序从开发机的 6.1 内核对到生产集群的 6.6 LTS，最常见的翻车不是逻辑错误，而是三个悄无声息的退化：注册缓冲在低 <code>RLIMIT_MEMLOCK</code> 的容器里被 <code>ENOMEM</code> 拒绝，SQPOLL 线程因 <code>sq_thread_idle</code> 太短反复进入唤醒路径，以及突发流量下 CQ 环塞满后程序拿到 <code>-EBUSY</code> 却当成致命错误退出。这三件事都属于&quot;参数与内核能力&quot;层，直接决定高并发网关与存储引擎能否在真实负载下跑住。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>生产调优在 io_uring 语境下可拆成三层互相牵制的决策：<strong>能力探测</strong>（内核支持哪些 setup flag 与 feature bit）、<strong>提交侧摊销</strong>（把 N 次请求压进尽量少的 <code>io_uring_enter</code>）、<strong>完成侧韧性</strong>（CQ 环满时事件不丢、内存锁定不失败）。三层任一失配，另外两层的调优都会被抵消。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;io_uring_setup(entries, params)&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;返回的 features 位&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;IORING_FEAT_NODROP&lt;br/&gt;5.5+: CQ 溢出事件暂存内核&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; D[&quot;IORING_FEAT_SQPOLL_NONFIXED&lt;br/&gt;5.11+: 无需注册文件&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; E[&quot;IORING_FEAT_SINGLE_MMAP&lt;br/&gt;5.4+: SQ/CQ 单次 mmap&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; F[&quot;提交侧: 批 SQE + enter(to_submit=N)&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G{&quot;CQ 环是否有空位?&quot;}&#10;  G --&gt;|有| H[&quot;正常写入 CQE&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt;|无且 NODROP| I[&quot;overflow 链表暂存&lt;br/&gt;下一轮 flush&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt;|无且无 NODROP| J[&quot;返回 -EBUSY&lt;br/&gt;必须 reap 后重试&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"io_uring_setup(entries, params)\"] --&gt; B{\"返回的 features 位\"}\n  B --&gt; C[\"IORING_FEAT_NODROP&lt;br/&gt;5.5+: CQ 溢出事件暂存内核\"]\n  B --&gt; D[\"IORING_FEAT_SQPOLL_NONFIXED&lt;br/&gt;5.11+: 无需注册文件\"]\n  B --&gt; E[\"IORING_FEAT_SINGLE_MMAP&lt;br/&gt;5.4+: SQ/CQ 单次 mmap\"]\n  C --&gt; F[\"提交侧: 批 SQE + enter(to_submit=N)\"]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G{\"CQ 环是否有空位?\"}\n  G --&gt;|有| H[\"正常写入 CQE\"]\n  G --&gt;|无且 NODROP| I[\"overflow 链表暂存&lt;br/&gt;下一轮 flush\"]\n  G --&gt;|无且无 NODROP| J[\"返回 -EBUSY&lt;br/&gt;必须 reap 后重试\"]</pre><p>关键约束：应用<strong>不能假设</strong>某个 setup flag 一定可用，<code>io_uring_setup()</code> 返回的 <code>params.features</code> 是唯一权威的能力来源（来源：man7.org <code>io_uring_setup(2)</code>）。下表给出 2026 年生产集群广泛部署的内核版本与对应特性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性 / flag</th>\n<th>引入内核</th>\n<th>生产意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>IORING_FEAT_SINGLE_MMAP</code></td>\n<td>5.4</td>\n<td>SQ+CQ 环单次 <code>mmap</code>，映射数 3→2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>IORING_FEAT_NODROP</code></td>\n<td>5.5</td>\n<td>CQ 满时事件暂存内核，<strong>不丢完成</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>IORING_SETUP_SUBMIT_ALL</code></td>\n<td>5.18</td>\n<td>单条请求出错不中断整批提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>IORING_SETUP_COOP_TASKRUN</code></td>\n<td>5.19</td>\n<td>减少强制中断调用线程的 task_work</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>IORING_REGISTER_PBUF_RING</code></td>\n<td>5.19</td>\n<td>注册式 provided buffer ring，替代逐 buffer PROVIDE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>IORING_SETUP_SINGLE_ISSUER</code></td>\n<td>6.0</td>\n<td>提交线程唯一，换取更低内核开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>IORING_SETUP_DEFER_TASKRUN</code></td>\n<td>6.1</td>\n<td>完成处理延迟到下次进入内核，依赖 SINGLE_ISSUER</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>IORING_SETUP_REGISTERED_FD_ONLY</code></td>\n<td>6.5</td>\n<td>环 fd 本身也可注册，须配 <code>NO_MMAP</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>IORING_SETUP_NO_SQARRAY</code></td>\n<td>6.6</td>\n<td>去掉 SQ 索引数组间接层，直接索引 SQE</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>版本号来自 liburing 手册页（<code>io_uring_setup.2</code> 标注 &quot;Available since X.Y&quot;）与内核 UAPI 头 <code>io_uring.h</code>。2026-10-03 时点的部署基线：最新稳定版 <strong>7.2.9</strong>，同期 LTS 为 <strong>6.18.55 / 6.12.112 / 6.6.158 / 6.1.189</strong>（来源：kernel.org 首页）；liburing 最新稳定版 <strong>2.15</strong>（2026-06-29，来源：github.com/axboe/liburing/releases）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内核版本特性矩阵与部署基线\">内核版本特性矩阵与部署基线</h2><p>真正让&quot;版本矩阵&quot;复杂的是<strong>下游内核的 backport</strong>：RHEL / 云厂商内核常把高版本特性回移到 5.14、6.1 这类长期分支，&quot;内核版本号 ≥ X&quot;并不等价于&quot;特性可用&quot;。可移植的做法是启动时读 <code>params.features</code> 逐位判断，缓存进进程级能力结构体，后续提交路径按它分支。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"struct io_uring_params p = {0};&#10;int ring_fd = io_uring_setup(4096, &amp;p);   /* 浪费一两次 setup 换取真相 */&#10;int nodrop    = p.features &amp; IORING_FEAT_NODROP;&#10;int sqpoll_ok = p.features &amp; IORING_FEAT_SQPOLL_NONFIXED;&#10;int ext_arg   = p.features &amp; IORING_FEAT_EXT_ARG;   /* 5.11+ */\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> io_uring_params p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ring_fd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> io_uring_setup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4096</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   /* 浪费一两次 setup 换取真相 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nodrop    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p.features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> IORING_FEAT_NODROP;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sqpoll_ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p.features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> IORING_FEAT_SQPOLL_NONFIXED;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ext_arg   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p.features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> IORING_FEAT_EXT_ARG;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   /* 5.11+ */</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>IORING_FEAT_EXT_ARG</code>（5.11+）值得单独留意：只有它置位时，<code>io_uring_enter</code> 才能接受 <code>struct io_uring_getevents_arg</code>，在同一调用里携带信号掩码与<strong>超时</strong>（来源：man7.org <code>io_uring_enter(2)</code>）。&quot;等待完成但最多等 N 毫秒&quot;的模型在 5.11 以下只能靠 <code>SIGALRM</code> 或额外 timerfd——这是能力边界而非可选优化。</p>\n<p>SQPOLL 是另一个版本坑。5.11 之前 SQPOLL 环<strong>必须</strong>用注册文件，否则提交的 IO 以 <code>EBADF</code> 失败；5.11 引入 <code>IORING_FEAT_SQPOLL_NONFIXED</code> 才允许普通 fd；5.13 移除了非特权使用所需的能力要求（来源：liburing <code>io_uring_setup.2</code>）。容器缺少 <code>CAP_SYS_NICE</code> 时 SQPOLL 会在启动阶段失败——这是它适合&quot;探测后启用&quot;的原因。务实策略是默认走 interrupt-driven ring + SINGLE_ISSUER + DEFER_TASKRUN，只在探测到 <code>SQPOLL_NONFIXED</code> 且权限允许时才切 SQPOLL。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sqe-批处理与提交侧摊销\">SQE 批处理与提交侧摊销</h2><p><code>io_uring_enter()</code> 的 <code>to_submit</code> 是&quot;一次系统调用消费多少 SQE&quot;的旋钮。应用把 N 个 SQE 放进 SQ 环、推进 tail，然后一次 <code>enter(to_submit=N)</code> 让内核全部消费；返回值是<strong>成功消费的 SQE 数</strong>，SQPOLL 模式下通常等于 <code>to_submit</code>（来源：man7.org <code>io_uring_enter(2)</code>）。批大小记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>、总请求数记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，系统调用次数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mi>B</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\left\\lceil \\frac{N}{B} \\right\\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>单请求摊销成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S/N \\approx 1/B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>：从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 提到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B=32</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span></span></span></span></span>，系统调用开销被摊薄约 32 倍。但另一面是<strong>延迟</strong>——批次填不满时队头请求要等后面的 SQE 一起提交。经验做法是双阈值触发：凑满 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 或等待超过一个微秒级窗口就提交，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>实际</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mtext>窗口内到达的请求数</mtext><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{实际} = \\min\\left(B_{max},\\ 1 + \\text{窗口内到达的请求数}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">实际</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">窗口内到达的请求数</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>批处理必须与 <code>IOSQE_IO_LINK</code> 链式语义区分开。手册页明确指出：<strong>链不能跨提交生效</strong>——即使一次提交里最后一条 SQE 带 <code>IOSQE_IO_LINK</code>，该链也在此终结（来源：man7.org <code>io_uring_enter(2)</code>）。把本应成链的操作拆到不同批次提交，会让第二条在第一条件未满足时抢先执行，这是最隐蔽的正确性陷阱。</p>\n<p>另外一个提交侧约束：<code>IOSQE_ASYNC</code> 或内核判定需 punt 到 worker 的请求会拖慢整批的消费语义，但 SQE 槽位在消费后即可复用（内核如需保留会私自拷贝）；<code>IORING_ENTER_SQ_WAIT</code> 让调用阻塞到&quot;至少有一个 SQ 环条目空闲&quot;，是 SQPOLL 下解决 SQ 环写满的标准手段。</p>\n<p>SQPOLL 的两个旋钮是 <code>sq_thread_idle</code>（毫秒）与 <code>IORING_SETUP_SQ_AFF</code> 绑核。空闲超过 <code>sq_thread_idle</code>，内核线程置位 <code>IORING_SQ_NEED_WAKEUP</code>，应用须用 <code>io_uring_enter(..., IORING_ENTER_SQ_WAKEUP)</code> 唤醒（来源：liburing <code>io_uring_setup.2</code>）——设得太小会让高吞吐场景频繁落入唤醒路径。绑核须注意容器 cgroup 的 <code>cpuset.cpus</code> 会改变允许的 CPU 集合。提交侧能力详见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../uring-ring-sqe-cqe-mechanics/submission-polling-sqpoll-iopoll-enter\">提交与轮询模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cqe-溢出-nodrop-ebusy-与-ebadr\">CQE 溢出：NODROP、EBUSY 与 EBADR</h2><p>CQ 环是有界数组，条目数默认等于 <code>entries</code>（可用 <code>IORING_SETUP_CQSIZE</code> 指定 <code>cq_entries</code>，该值必须<strong>大于</strong> <code>entries</code>，且可能被向上取整到 2 的幂）。内核硬上限是 <code>IORING_MAX_ENTRIES = 32768</code>、<code>IORING_MAX_CQ_ENTRIES = 65536</code>（来源：内核 <code>io_uring/io_uring.h</code> 的 <code>#define</code>）；超过上限若未设 <code>IORING_SETUP_CLAMP</code> 会直接 <code>EINVAL</code>。当提交快于收割时 CQ 环会满，行为完全由 <code>IORING_FEAT_NODROP</code>（5.5+）决定：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>内核行为</th>\n<th>应用应做</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>有 NODROP，CQ 满</td>\n<td>完成事件存入内核 overflow 链表，不丢</td>\n<td>尽快 reap，事件随后 flush</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有 NODROP，<code>GETEVENTS</code> 时 overflow 未全部 flush</td>\n<td>返回 <code>-EBUSY</code></td>\n<td>继续 reap 并重试，<strong>非致命</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无 NODROP，CQ 满</td>\n<td>提交返回 <code>-EBUSY</code>（请求过度提交）</td>\n<td>reap 完成事件后重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有 NODROP 但内存极低</td>\n<td>返回 <code>-EBADR</code>，确有 CQE 被丢</td>\n<td>视为严重告警；状态下次调用清除</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>-EBADR</code> 被手册页描述为 &quot;extremely rare&quot;，标志内存严重不足（来源：man7.org <code>io_uring_enter(2)</code>）。把 <code>EBUSY</code> 当致命错误、或在循环里不做退避地重试，是两种典型的错误处理。稳健的收割循环要同时处理批收割与溢出退避：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"for (;;) {&#10;    int n = io_uring_peek_batch_cqe(&amp;ring, cqes, BATCH);&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) handle(cqes[i]);&#10;    io_uring_cq_advance(&amp;ring, n);          /* 先归还槽位再提交 */&#10;    int ret = io_uring_submit_and_wait(&amp;ring, pending);&#10;    if (ret == -EBUSY || ret == -EAGAIN) {  /* 溢出，非错误 */&#10;        reap_all(&amp;ring);                     /* 排空 CQ 再重试 */&#10;        continue;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (;;) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> io_uring_peek_batch_cqe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ring, cqes, BATCH);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cqes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    io_uring_cq_advance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ring, n);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          /* 先归还槽位再提交 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ret </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> io_uring_submit_and_wait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ring, pending);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ret </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">EBUSY </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ret </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">EAGAIN) {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 溢出，非错误 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        reap_all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ring);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                     /* 排空 CQ 再重试 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        continue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>先 <code>cq_advance</code> 再 <code>submit</code></strong> 的顺序至关重要：只有归还了 CQ 槽位，内核才有空间 flush 出 overflow 事件，否则会陷入&quot;越提交越满&quot;的死循环。这也是 <code>CQSIZE</code> 调优的动机——把 CQ 环设成 SQ 环的 2 倍以上可吸收突发完成。CQ 环布局见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../uring-ring-sqe-cqe-mechanics/shared-ring-mmap-sq-cq-layout-entries\">共享环内存布局</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内存锁定-注册缓冲-rlimit_memlock-与-1gib-上限\">内存锁定：注册缓冲、RLIMIT_MEMLOCK 与 1GiB 上限</h2><p>注册缓冲区（<code>IORING_REGISTER_BUFFERS</code>，5.1+）让内核预先固定（pin）用户内存，后续 <code>READ_FIXED</code>/<code>WRITE_FIXED</code> 跳过每请求的地址翻译，是 io_uring 相对 epoll 的核心性能来源之一。代价是这些内存<strong>被锁定并计入用户的 <code>RLIMIT_MEMLOCK</code></strong>（来源：man7.org <code>io_uring_register(2)</code>）。生产里最常踩的三个约束：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>锁内存限额</strong>。违反非零的 <code>RLIMIT_MEMLOCK</code> 软限制返回 <code>ENOMEM</code>，持有 <code>CAP_IPC_LOCK</code> 可绕过该项强制。容器默认 <code>memlock</code> 常低至 64KB～8MB，注册 256MB 缓冲会直接失败。正确做法是在编排层显式设置 <code>ulimit -l</code>（或容器 <code>--ulimit memlock</code>）。</li>\n<li><strong>每缓冲 1GiB 上限</strong>。单个 iovec 超过 1GiB 返回 <code>EFAULT</code>，大缓冲必须切分。</li>\n<li><strong>必须是匿名内存</strong>。<code>malloc()</code> 或 <code>MAP_ANONYMOUS</code> 的 <code>mmap()</code> 可以，文件映射内存不受支持；用大页时即使只用了一部分，<strong>整个大页都会被 pin 住</strong>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>注册文件（<code>IORING_REGISTER_FILES</code>）没有锁内存负担，它只把 fd 表交给内核，配合 <code>IOSQE_FIXED_FILE</code> 用数组下标代替真实 fd。网络密集的网关通常两者并用：文件注册用于 socket 表，缓冲注册用于接收缓冲池。5.13 之前注册操作会等待环空闲，即阻塞在飞行中的请求上——高负载热路径做动态重注册时会明显停顿。提供的 buffer ring（<code>IORING_REGISTER_PBUF_RING</code>，5.19+）把&quot;逐 buffer 提交 PROVIDE&quot;改成&quot;应用侧环形补货 + 内核直接取用&quot;：<code>ring_entries</code> 必须是 2 的幂、上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>15</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>32768</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{15}=32768</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32768</span></span></span></span></span>，<code>ring_addr</code> 必须页对齐（来源：man7.org <code>io_uring_register.2</code>）。配合 multishot 是网络场景标准配置，详见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../network-disk-workloads-zerocopy/network-recv-send-multishot-provide-buffers\">recv/send multishot 与 provided buffers</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>生产调优不是一组固定参数，而是三层决策按当前内核能力收敛的结果。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>能力以 <code>params.features</code> 为准</strong>，不以版本号为准——下游 backport 让版本号不可靠；启动时探测并缓存是最小代价的保险。</li>\n<li><strong>部署基线</strong>：6.6 LTS 覆盖 SINGLE_ISSUER / DEFER_TASKRUN / pbuffer ring 全部能力，配 liburing 2.15。</li>\n<li><strong>提交侧</strong>：批大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 把系统调用摊销到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>；双阈值（凑满或超时）平衡吞吐与尾延迟；<code>IOSQE_IO_LINK</code> 链不可跨提交。</li>\n<li><strong>完成侧</strong>：5.5+ 的 NODROP 保证事件不丢，<code>EBUSY</code> 是溢出信号而非故障，<code>EBADR</code> 才是内存告急；先 <code>cq_advance</code> 再 <code>submit</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>内存锁定</strong>：注册缓冲计入 <code>RLIMIT_MEMLOCK</code>、单缓冲 ≤1GiB、必须匿名内存；容器 <code>memlock</code> 限额须在编排层显式抬高。</li>\n<li><strong>SQPOLL</strong> 只在探测到 <code>SQPOLL_NONFIXED</code> 且权限允许时启用，<code>sq_thread_idle</code> 与 <code>SQ_AFF</code> 绑核是两个必调项。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把这六条做成启动自检（探测 → 报警 → 降级），比在任何单一内核版本上把参数调到极致更能保证跨节点一致性。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生产调优：内核版本特性矩阵、SQE 批处理、CQE 溢出与内存锁定","id":"生产调优-内核版本特性矩阵-sqe-批处理-cqe-溢出与内存锁定"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"内核版本特性矩阵与部署基线","id":"内核版本特性矩阵与部署基线"},{"level":2,"text":"SQE 批处理与提交侧摊销","id":"sqe-批处理与提交侧摊销"},{"level":2,"text":"CQE 溢出：NODROP、EBUSY 与 EBADR","id":"cqe-溢出-nodrop-ebusy-与-ebadr"},{"level":2,"text":"内存锁定：注册缓冲、RLIMIT_MEMLOCK 与 1GiB 上限","id":"内存锁定-注册缓冲-rlimit_memlock-与-1gib-上限"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"语言绑定生态：liburing、Rust io-uring/glommio/tokio-uring 的抽象层次与选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/io-uring-linux-high-performance-async-io-engineering/perf-tuning-language-bindings-production/liburing-rust-bindings-runtime-selection"},"next":{"title":"可观测性与故障语义：错误传播、部分完成、seccomp/容器兼容与回滚","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/io-uring-linux-high-performance-async-io-engineering/perf-tuning-language-bindings-production/observability-error-semantics-seccomp-container-rollback"}}